# The pointer's shape over a page (CSS UI 4 §8.1.1, `cursor`): the keyword
# the page gives the box under the pointer, inherited by what is inside it;
# with `auto`, an I-beam over words and in a text field, a hand over a link
# and the arrow elsewhere. An image in the list is passed over for the
# keyword that must end it; a list no engine takes changes nothing.
#
# The content area starts 76 px down. Each row of cursor.html is 20 px tall
# and 300 px wide, its words 10 px a letter from the left edge: x = 30 is on
# the words, x = 280 past their end.
resize 800 600
open cursor.html
advance 50 2
# The computed values: inherited, the keyword after images, the last valid
# declaration, the prefixed spelling, and two lists that are not taken.
assert-title grab wait pointer zoom-in auto auto

# auto: an I-beam over the words, the arrow beside them.
move 30 86
assert-cursor text
move 280 86
assert-cursor default

# The page's keyword, on the words and beside them alike.
move 30 106
assert-cursor pointer
move 280 106
assert-cursor pointer

# A link is a hand without being told.
move 30 126
assert-cursor pointer

# Words the page calls `default` do not show the I-beam.
move 30 146
assert-cursor default

# Inherited by the span inside.
move 30 166
assert-cursor grab

# The keyword after the images.
move 30 186
assert-cursor wait

# An unknown keyword leaves the declaration before it standing.
move 30 206
assert-cursor pointer

move 30 226
assert-cursor none

move 30 246
assert-cursor zoom-in

# The page's word outranks what a link would show.
move 30 266
assert-cursor text

# A list with no keyword at its end is not taken: auto, over words.
move 30 286
assert-cursor text

move 30 306
assert-cursor col-resize

# A text field and a button, as before.
move 30 326
assert-cursor text
move 20 356
assert-cursor default

# An image with one coordinate is not an image entry: auto.
move 30 386
assert-cursor text
